      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 421511690,
          "type": null,
          "body": "As discussed in #16868, Homebrew's zlib.pc [currently hard-codes /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools](https://github.com/Homebrew/brew/issues/5068). I'm not sure what the ultimate fix should be, but using xcode-select seems like a reasonable workaround for now.",
